# File: CITATION.cff
#
# The citation metadata of this repository, in the Citation File Format
# (https://citation-file-format.github.io/), which GitHub's "Cite this
# repository" button and tools such as cffconvert read, and from which
# Zenodo takes a release's title, authors, license, keywords, abstract and
# notes (the `message`).  Update `version` and `date-released` at every
# tagged release.  When a release has been archived, add its DOIs: `doi:`,
# the only key GitHub's button reads, and both DOIs under `identifiers`.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "Agda-native AIR: an Agda-native artificial intelligence reasoning environment"
abstract: >-
  Interaction, retrieval and evaluation infrastructure that lets AI coding
  agents work with the Agda proof assistant: AgdaDojang, programmatic access
  to Agda proof states and hole filling; agda-mcp, a Model Context Protocol
  server that exposes type checking, goal introspection, live scope, type
  and definition queries and corpus search to any MCP client; agda-strux,
  structured extraction of Agda libraries into retrieval-friendly corpus
  data; and deterministic proof-completion benchmarks and reports.
authors:
  - family-names: DeMeo
    given-names: William
    email: williamdemeo@gmail.com
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1832-5690"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/formalverification/agda-native-air"
url: "https://github.com/formalverification/agda-native-air"
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-10-14"
keywords:
  - Agda
  - proof assistant
  - Model Context Protocol
  - AI-assisted theorem proving
  - formal verification
  - corpus extraction
